\n\r\nThe webhooks will send a message not even mentioning jane.doe - example output:    \r\n> [code/sample-nodejs] Issue assigned to **john.smith**: # 2 Need to upgrade to ES6. by john.smith\r\n> [code/sample-nodejs] Issue unassigned: # 1 Need to upgrade to ES6. by john.smith\r\n\r\n**Expected result:**    \r\nA webhook message is sent saying:     \r\n> [code/sample-nodejs] Issue assigned to **jane.doe**: # 2 Need to upgrade to ES6. by john.smith\r\n> [code/sample-nodejs] Issue unassigned: # 1 Need to upgrade to ES6. by john.smith\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/12309/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/12309/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":3609807074,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDM2MDk4MDcwNzQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/events/3609807074","actor":{"login":"ydelafollye","id":20755819,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzU1ODE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20755819?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydelafollye","html_url":"https://github.com/ydelafollye","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydelafollye/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydelafollye/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydelafollye/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydelafollye/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydelafollye/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydelafollye/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydelafollye/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydelafollye/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydelafollye/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"publi